  "description": "Na₄WO₄ crystallizes in the tetragonal I4/m space group. Na is bonded to five equivalent O atoms to form a mixture of distorted corner and edge-sharing NaO₅ trigonal bipyramids. There are a spread of Na-O bond distances ranging from 2.32-2.62 Å. W is bonded in a square co-planar geometry to four equivalent O atoms. All W-O bond lengths are 1.93 Å. O is bonded to five equivalent Na and one W atom to form a mixture of distorted corner and edge-sharing ONa₅W octahedra. The corner-sharing octahedral tilt angles range from 0-17°.",
